@startuml UC-17-QuanLyDiem
!pragma layout smetana

title UC-17: Quản lý điểm

actor        "Teacher"                                     as Teacher
boundary     "ScoreManagementPage\n(React)"                as ScorePage
control      "ScoreController\n(REST)"                     as ScoreController
control      "ScoreService"                                as ScoreService
entity       "ClassRepository"                             as ClassRepo
entity       "ScoreRepository"                             as ScoreRepo
database     "MySQL"                                        as DB

== Main Success Scenario ==

Teacher -> ScorePage: 1. Chọn lớp học
ScorePage -> ScoreController: 2. GET /api/scores/init\n?classId=
activate ScoreController

ScoreController -> ScoreService: 3. prepareScoreTable(classId)
activate ScoreService

ScoreService -> ClassRepo: 4. findById(classId)
activate ClassRepo
ClassRepo -> DB: 5. SELECT * FROM classes\nWHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> ClassRepo: 6. Class entity
deactivate DB
ClassRepo --> ScoreService: 7. Class
deactivate ClassRepo

alt 8. Class status is "Studying" or "Finished"
  ScoreService -> ScoreRepo: 9. findByClassId(classId)
  activate ScoreRepo
  ScoreRepo -> DB: 10. SELECT s.*, stu.full_name\nFROM scores s\nJOIN students stu\nON s.student_id = stu.id\nWHERE s.class_id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> ScoreRepo: 11. List<Score>
  deactivate DB
  ScoreRepo --> ScoreService: 12. scoreList
  deactivate ScoreRepo

  ScoreService --> ScoreController: 13. ScoreTableDTO\n{scores, students}
  deactivate ScoreService
  ScoreController --> ScorePage: 14. 200 OK\n{bảng điểm}
  deactivate ScoreController
  ScorePage -> ScorePage: 15. Hiển thị bảng điểm\n(giữa kỳ, cuối kỳ,\ntổng kết, nhận xét)

  Teacher -> ScorePage: 16. Chọn học viên
  Teacher -> ScorePage: 17. Nhập điểm & nhận xét
  Teacher -> ScorePage: 18. Click "Lưu"
  ScorePage -> ScoreController: 19. PUT /api/scores\n{classId, studentId,\nmidterm, final, total,\ncomment}
  activate ScoreController

  ScoreController -> ScoreService: 20. saveScore(data)
  activate ScoreService

  ScoreService -> ScoreService: 21. Validate 0 <= score <= 10

  alt 22. Điểm hợp lệ
    ScoreService -> ScoreRepo: 23. save(score)
    activate ScoreRepo
    ScoreRepo -> DB: 24. INSERT INTO scores\n(student_id, class_id, midterm,\nfinal, total, comment)
    activate DB
    DB --> ScoreRepo: 25. Score entity
    deactivate DB
    ScoreRepo --> ScoreService: 26. savedScore
    deactivate ScoreRepo

    ScoreService -> ScoreService: 27. Ghi Audit Log
    ScoreService --> ScoreController: 28. ScoreDTO
    deactivate ScoreService
    ScoreController --> ScorePage: 29. 200 OK\n{score info}
    deactivate ScoreController
    ScorePage -> ScorePage: 30. Cập nhật bảng điểm
    ScorePage --> Teacher: 31. "Lưu điểm thành công"

  else 22a. Điểm không hợp lệ
    ScoreService --> ScoreController: 32. Throw InvalidScoreException
    deactivate ScoreService
    ScoreController --> ScorePage: 33. 400 Bad Request\n"Điểm phải từ 0 đến 10"
    deactivate ScoreController
    ScorePage --> Teacher: 34. Hiển thị thông báo lỗi
  end

else 8a. Class chưa bắt đầu
  ScoreService --> ScoreController: 35. Throw ClassNotStartedException
  deactivate ScoreService
  ScoreController --> ScorePage: 36. 400 Bad Request\n"Lớp học chưa bắt đầu"
  deactivate ScoreController
  ScorePage --> Teacher: 37. Hiển thị thông báo lỗi
end

== Critical Exception: DB Error ==

Teacher -> ScorePage: 38. Nhập điểm và lưu
ScorePage -> ScoreController: 39. PUT /api/scores
activate ScoreController
ScoreController -> ScoreService: 40. saveScore(data)
activate ScoreService
ScoreService -> ScoreRepo: 41. save(score)
activate ScoreRepo
ScoreRepo -> DB: 42. INSERT ...
activate DB
DB --> ScoreRepo: 43. SQL Exception
deactivate DB
ScoreRepo --> ScoreService: 44. Throw DataAccessException
deactivate ScoreRepo
ScoreService --> ScoreController: 45. Throw SystemErrorException
deactivate ScoreService
ScoreController --> ScorePage: 46. 500 Internal Server Error
deactivate ScoreController
ScorePage --> Teacher: 47. "Hệ thống có lỗi,\nvui lòng thử lại"

@enduml
